OL,3,ANine killed as small jet crashes on
OL,4,AFlorida street
OL,5,
OL,6,FA business jet crashed in a
OL,7,Fneighbourhood in Florida on Sunday,
OL,8,Fkilling all nine people on board, the
OL,9,FUS transport secretary has said.
OL,11,FThe crash happened near Cresthaven,
OL,12,Fsome nine miles (14 km) from
OL,13,FMar-a-Lago, President Donald Trump's
OL,14,Fresort in the wealthy enclave of Palm
OL,15,FBeach County, around 12:50 EST (17:50
OL,16,FGMT).
OL,18,FImages from after the crash show a
OL,19,Fcrater in the middle of a residential
OL,20,Froad, with patches of fire and pieces
OL,21,Fof concrete and debris from the Learjet
OL,22,F60 aircraft scattered.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
